## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: teensy-3-5
name: "PJRC Teensy 3.5 — MK64FX512VMD12 ARM Cortex-M4F 120MHz HW-FPU, 512KB Flash, 256KB RAM, 64 GPIO, SDIO SD, ETH MAC, 2xDAC"
manufacturer: "PJRC.COM LLC"
mcu: "NXP/Freescale MK64FX512VMD12 — ARM Cortex-M4F 120MHz; 32-bit hardware FPU; 16-DMA; Crypto/RNG/CRC; Ethernet MAC"
category: maker
image: teensy-3-5.svg
url: "https://www.pjrc.com/store/teensy35.html"

